      "id": 106,
      "hub_id": 184,
      "guid": "com.skitles.profile.editor",
      "name": "SPT-AKI Profile Editor",
      "slug": "spt-aki-profile-editor",
      "teaser": "This tool let you edit your SPT profile easily. This let you edit everything you can find in your profile!",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/184.png",
      "downloads": 736411,
      "favourites_count": 107,
      "description": "<h3>SPT BE versions not supported at all, only last stable release wich defined in <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/SkiTles55/SPT-AKI-Profile-Editor/blob/master/ENGREADME.md\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">README</a></h3>\n<h3>No support here. Support is only available on  <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/SkiTles55/SPT-AKI-Profile-Editor/issues/new/choose\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>GitHub</strong></a> and <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.gg/NTwSA4AfRP\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Discord</strong></a> for bug reports created according to the specified requirements, with all necessary information provided.</h3>\n<h3>DO NOT INSTALL INTO YOUR <code>USER/MODS</code> FOLDER</h3>\n<p>FAQ: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/SkiTles55/SPT-AKI-Profile-Editor/blob/master/ENGFAQ.md\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/SkiTles55/SPT-AKI-Profile-Editor/blob/master/ENGFAQ.md</a></p>\n<h2>Require you to install:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://dotnet.microsoft.com/en-us/download/dotnet/thank-you/runtime-desktop-9.0.11-windows-x64-installer\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">.NET 9.0 Desktop x64</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://dotnet.microsoft.com/en-us/download/dotnet/thank-you/runtime-desktop-6.0.4-windows-x64-installer\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">.NET 6.0 Desktop x64 (Only for app version below 4.0.1)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Capabilities:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Level, nickname, character voice</li>\n<li>Switching between regular\\ large pockets</li>\n<li>Hideout building levels</li>\n<li>Trader relationship levels</li>\n<li>Quest statuses</li>\n<li>Skill\\ Mastering levels</li>\n<li>Examined items</li>\n<li>Removing\\adding items in stash (WIP), adding money</li>\n<li>Import\\ export\\ removing weapon builds</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Simple, intuitive interface</li>\n<li>Multilingual, with the ability to edit localization</li>\n<li>Automatic backups every time you save your profile</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong>How to use it ?</strong></h2>\n<p>* Extract to any folder outside your SPT folder and run SPT-AKI Profile Editor.exe.</p>\n<p>* Select your SPT Server folder</p>\n<p>* Choose your account</p>\n<p>* Make the wanted edits</p>\n<p>* Click the save button</p>\n",
      "detail_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/106/spt-aki-profile-editor",
