          "version": "3.1.0",
          "description": "To install, unzip the downloaded archive and run setup.exe\n\nChanges:\n\nMigration to SPT 3.10.5 (previous server versions are no longer compatible).\n\nMinor changes to the application settings screen.\n\nFixed loading the list of available crafts in the hideout.\n\nFixed setting the flea market reputation.\n\nFixed infinite change of the PMC level when saving seasonal quests.\n\nCorrectly improving hideout zones that have storage.\n\nFix for loading of empty profiles.\n\nFixed a bug with the Japanese localization.\n\nReworking the \"Fast mode\".\n\nA note about the presence of special slots has been added to the list of pockets.",
